---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TitleCard from "../../components/TitleCard.astro";
import { useTranslations } from "../../i18n/utils";

const lang = "en" as const;
const t = useTranslations(lang);
const intro =
  "By day I build APIs and gateways in TypeScript. When there is time, I leave my own universe for another and learn how to survive there — each place with its own way of staying alive.";
---

<BaseLayout title={t("nav.about")} description={intro}>
  <TitleCard
    eyebrow={t("site.name")}
    title={t("nav.about")}
    description={intro}
  />

  <div class="article mt-8">
    <h2>The universes</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>The backend/API universe</strong> — Kong Gateway, Fastify, clean
        architecture, error responses shaped by zod. My repo{" "}
        <code>express-zod-api-mini-repoduction</code> is misspelled right in its
        name — "repoduction" — and I leave it that way. Fixing it would lose the
        point.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>The games universe</strong> — Pong and FlappyBird written in
        ExcaliburJS along with CS50 Game Dev. A course assignment, but written
        in ExcaliburJS instead of the tool the course prescribed — just to get
        to live in TypeScript.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>The operating-system universe</strong> — CachyOS, mangowm
        (Wayland), Noctalia; <code>dotfiles</code> is the map of that universe.
        No sway, no hyprland — mangowm, which googling turns up few results for.
        The dotfiles are the only map there is.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>The AI-agent universe</strong> — <code>puppycat-skills</code>{" "}
        and the very page you are reading. I keep skills the way I keep a cat,
        and the house rules are: no making things up, no flattery, and if a plan
        is bad say it straight.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>The universe that dissolved</strong> — .NET/C#, a fashion shop
        in MVC. There I learned old code, and learned how a universe leaves in
        silence.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      GitHub is where I build everything:{" "}
      <a href="https://github.com/huyhoang160593">
        https://github.com/huyhoang160593
      </a>
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
